{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2022-12-12 16:15:00', 'title': 'TRIMBLE TO ACQUIRE TRANSPOREON TO STRENGTHEN AND ACCELERATE CONNECT & SCALE STRATEGY', 'text': "SCALED CLOUD-BASED TRANSPORTATION MANAGEMENT PLATFORM HIGH GROWTH & PROFITABLE SOFTWARE LEADER EXPANDS TRIMBLE'S ADDRESSABLE MARKET EXPECTED TO BE IMMEDIATELY ACCRETIVE TO PRO FORMA REVENUE GROWTH AND NON-GAAP OPERATING MARGIN WESTMINSTER, COLO. , DEC. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS AGREED TO ACQUIRE TRANSPOREON, A LEADING CLOUD-BASED TRANSPORTATION MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE PLATFORM, IN AN ALL-CASH TRANSACTION VALUED AT €1.88 BILLION."}